^the container's PID 1 has parent: containerd-shim$
# SIGTERM was ignored, so docker stop waited for its timeout (10 seconds by default)
^docker stop took 1[0-2]s$
# the shim's reaping loop: wait for any child (-1), don't block (WNOHANG); the container was SIGKILLed
^wait4\(-1, \[\{WIFSIGNALED\(s\) && WTERMSIG\(s\) == SIGKILL\}\], WNOHANG, …\) = [0-9]+$
# 128 + 9 (SIGKILL)
^docker reports: ExitCode=137$
